-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":164852920,"discussion_id":"79559eee85552ad6ba99471e613a6c107348b34f","body":"## 问题/功能描述\n\n修复卷积算子内核在非组优化预加载（`groupOptPreloadFlag`为假）场景下的逻辑错误。当未启用该优化时，内核代码仍将`groupOptIter`作为有效参数使用，导致数据加载偏移计算错误，影响卷积计算的正确性。\n\n## 修改方案描述\n\n在卷积数据加载工具类（`LoadAL1ToolsHWMode`和`LoadAL1ToolsMMode`）中，针对非组优化预加载的场景，在加载数据前将传入的`groupOptIter`参数显式重置为0。这确保了后续计算全局内存偏移时，与`groupOptIter`相关的项不会引入错误偏移，从而保证数据加载位置的准确性。","created_at":"2026-03-10T20:32:02+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-10T20:32:02+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":164852927,"discussion_id":"70ea4021864c775fc25c0062deb77b16773ae72f","body":":large_blue_circle: source code change are detected, tasks labels is removed in this pull request!","created_at":"2026-03-10T20:32:04+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-10T20:32:04+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":164853199,"discussion_id":"0459d60908fee9ad97831b520f3c2ba44421be32","body":"compile","created_at":"2026-03-10T20:33:39+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-10T20:33:39+08:00","user":{"id":"69241f243197e961bc360dbb","login":"zhangxiyan7","object_id":"69241f243197e961bc360dbb","name":"zhangxiyan7","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/ef/fa/e452786286f572804f1879afcb69203bfb73ad880